        <body>
            <div xml:id="d355">

                <pb facs="0483" n="398" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg398"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.015315/10</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jones</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                            1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received March
                        26</hi>.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 156</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my cablegram of to-day, 3
                        P.M.,<anchor n="19" xml:id="d355-f1"/> I have the honor to inform you that
                    the annoying Flag-desecration incident at Juticalpa, has been closed, to my mind
                    satisfactorily, and I have so notified the Government of Honduras.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>I attach hereto a copy and translation of the Note from the Foreign Office, for
                    your information.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. Sambola Jones</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d355-a1.xml" xpointer="d355-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
